msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/general/gsoc.rst:48 bb3f5149211d4737967d0b175aa4a3f6
msgid ""
"A project proposal is what you will be judged upon. Write a clear proposal "
"on what you plan to do, the scope of your project, and why we should choose "
"you to do it. Proposals are the basis of the GSoC projects and therefore one "
"of the most important things to do well."
msgstr ""

